#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:1
#: b4f0073850a0444dbc5ab9ea82ab8b88
msgid "Run Mock Demo"
msgstr "运行模拟演示"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:3
#: f6cc3548773e48c083fe4513e305d55b
msgid ""
"Run a robot demonstration with the default `hardware:=mock_components` "
"plugin (`mock_components/GenericSystem` on Acone xacro). No Gazebo / "
"Isaac / physical robot."
msgstr ""
"用默认的 `hardware:=mock_components` 插件运行演示（Acone xacro 上为 "
"`mock_components/GenericSystem`）。不需要 Gazebo / Isaac / 真机。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:5
#: 21f22efbdefd405a80ccd9c768bc94ee
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:7
#: 5fdcb9f6a94b43f2a484763a564a8272
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) "
"done"
msgstr "已完成 [安装环境](../../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:8
#: 9979f8fe3267451d80e6ca1c41f9ca3c
msgid "Workspace initialized with `./init_repo.sh` and `colcon build`"
msgstr "已用 `./init_repo.sh` 初始化工作区并完成 `colcon build`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:9
#: b989606a3f9b414c88b5dea0faca60f9
msgid ""
"Lean branches (`arx-lift2s`, `panthera-ht`): `./quick_start.sh` (it "
"sources `install/` after a successful build). On `open-deploy-ws` `main`,"
" after `colcon build`, `source install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal"
" (standard ROS overlay; no extra env script)."
msgstr ""
"精简分支（`arx-lift2s`、`panthera-ht`）：`./quick_start.sh`（构建成功后会 source "
"`install/`）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 的 `main` 上，`colcon build` 之后在启动终端 `source "
"install/setup.bash`（标准 ROS overlay；没有额外环境脚本）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:11
#: 2ee8b82b3fb24f248f857485c8d3ba9e
