#: 2bd132d03c5842d19a526a9c97cb0e76
msgid ""
"`arms_target_manager` when `enable_arms_target_manager` is `true` "
"(default)"
msgstr "当 `enable_arms_target_manager` 为 `true`（默认）时启动 `arms_target_manager`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:33
#: 41911f01c32e44df8d994d8c44928cd8
msgid ""
"FSM starts in HOLD — `/fsm_command` `std_msgs/Int32` (`1` HOME, `2` HOLD,"
" `3` OCS2)"
msgstr ""
"FSM 从 HOLD 开始 — `/fsm_command` 为 `std_msgs/Int32`（`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` "
"OCS2）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:35
#: 60a515a1a9af4f01a3e00c0315a16a6c
msgid ""
"Do **not** publish `/target_pose`. That is not a stack-wide API. See [FSM"
" and Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md) and [ros2_control in "
"This Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)."
msgstr ""
"**不要**发布 `/target_pose`。那不是全栈通用 API。见 [FSM "
"与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md) 和 [本技术栈中的 "
"ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:37
#: 850e98b521e04479a61debafdd85b6d9
