"# Acone (dual-arm, not Lift 2S)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone\n"
"\n"
"# HighTorque Panthera HT\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:47
#: a7b59f3e99cb4cbf9420076c1b57c59d
msgid "Taku"
msgstr "Taku"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:49
#: 8cf91cd4413045678709d05f5c873121
msgid ""
"Taku lives on `robot_descriptions` **`feature/agilex`** "
"(`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`). See [Taku / "
"`feature/agilex`](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md) before this "
"launch."
msgstr ""
"Taku 在 `robot_descriptions` 的 **`feature/agilex`** 上"
"（`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`）。启动前先看 [Taku / "
"`feature/agilex`](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:51
#: 7e333b254ed14e1693cc8ad0fc1cefe9
msgid ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller taku_description\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=taku "
"hardware:=mock_components enable_gripper:=false\n"
msgstr ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller taku_description\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=taku "
"hardware:=mock_components enable_gripper:=false\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:57
#: ec270ecf5de04430802c820fc06a8ee6
msgid ""
"[`demo.launch.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch/demo.launch.py)"
" declares `enable_gripper` (default `true`). Taku’s field path uses "
"`enable_gripper:=false`."
msgstr ""
"[`demo.launch.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch/demo.launch.py)"
" 声明了 `enable_gripper`（默认 `true`）。Taku 现场路径使用 "
"`enable_gripper:=false`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:59
#: 7842e4a1a7544183a8d5bf49d5ea41b6
msgid ""
"In RViz, set **Fixed Frame** to **`agv_base`** (the package root link). "
"The default `demo.rviz` / `base_link` makes the model look missing. The "
"description’s `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` also sets "
"`marker_fixed_frame: agv_base`."
msgstr ""
"在 RViz 中把 **Fixed Frame** 设为 **`agv_base`**（包根 link）。默认 "
"`demo.rviz` / `base_link` 会让模型看起来消失。描述包的 "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 也设置了 `marker_fixed_frame: agv_base`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:61
#: a901e50a767f41fa911c1e41f988e071
msgid ""
"`hardware:=gz` (Gazebo) may need a GPU. Use mock + RViz as the default "
"verify path; see [Gazebo Simulation](../2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md) if "
"you need physics."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=gz`（Gazebo）可能需要 GPU。默认验证路径用 mock + RViz；需要物理仿真时见 "
"[Gazebo 仿真](../2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:63
#: 587a36d0325740faa4cd00393412ed2f
msgid "End-effector (`type`)"
msgstr "末端执行器（`type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:65
#: f9df01c4d0ca4433bddff3f47f0e9664
msgid ""
"Not `gripper:=`. This launch includes "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`. Symmetric EEF: `type:=`. "
"Different L/R: `left_type:=` and `right_type:=` together (**do not pass "
"`type:=`** then). Profile `defaults.end_effectors` applies unless "
"`use_profile_eef:=false`. See [Switch Robot](2-switch_robot.md) and "
"[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"不是 `gripper:=`。此 launch 包含 "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`。对称末端：`type:=`。左右不同：同时传 "
"`left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`（此时**不要再传 `type:=`**）。除非 "
"`use_profile_eef:=false`，否则使用 profile 的 `defaults.end_effectors`。见 "
"[切换机器人](2-switch_robot.md) 与 "
"[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:67
#: 2d37d76b48c242c8addad8aedee3816f
